
!.env.example
!.sidex/rules/
!.sidex/skills/
# /deploy    = maintainer deploy scripts and prod env
# /sidex-web = marketing site + dashboard (Next.js)
# =============================================================================
# Library lock files should not be committed (Cargo best practice).
# Local release packaging
# Memory, bench results, and other generated state live in ~/.sidex/.
# Only .sidex/rules/ and .sidex/skills/ are meant to be committed.
# Private — not part of the public app repo.
# SideX .gitignore
# The application lock (src-tauri/Cargo.lock) IS committed.
# ── Build output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Cargo.lock for library crates ───────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Cloudflare Wrangler (marketplace-proxy dev state) ────────────────────────
# ── Dependencies ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Environment / Secrets ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Extensions (auto-installed on first dev/build via npm run setup) ──────────
# ── IDE / Editor ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Incomplete Rust WASM extensions (stubs, not yet LSP-backed) ──────────────
# ── Local scratch / source reconstruction (never ship) ───────────────────────
# ── Logs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Misc ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── OS files ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Rust / Cargo ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Sidex ephemeral state (never commit) ─────────────────────────────────────
# ── Tauri generated ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Test / Coverage ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── WASM build artifacts (wasm-pack output) ──────────────────────────────────
